      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some NPC templates for you:\n\n1. Successful CEO: Reginald Thornton-Furst, a suave, well-dressed, and charming 45-year-old investment banker who owns a string of high-end skyscrapers in the city. He's a self-made millionaire with a penchant for expensive suits and a love for the finer things in life. His office is a sleek, modern penthouse with a stunning view of the city skyline.\n\n2. Friendly Neighbor: Maria Rodriguez, a warm and welcoming 32-year-old single mother who lives in a cozy brownstone in a vibrant, diverse neighborhood. She's always willing to lend a helping hand and is known for her delicious homemade empanadas and infectious smile. Her apartment is a colorful, cluttered mess of family photos and handmade crafts.\n\n3. High-Ranking Police Officer: Detective James \"Hawk\" Hawkins, a rugged, no-nonsense 50-year-old veteran cop with a thick, gruff demeanor and a sharp mind. He's a decorated war hero and a by-the-book kind of guy who always follows procedure. His office is a cramped, cluttered room in the police station with a worn, leather-bound desk and a faded \"World's Okayest Cop\"",
